  "description": "The META POWER SX 400 SIGNATURE AXS is an ultra-playful and agile e-bike and is an exclusive FOX Factory plus wireless drivetrain build. Made for lapping run after run.\n• Equipped with a FOX 38 Factory fork with Kashima coated stanchions: precise and dynamic thanks to the new Grip X2 cartridge. Rear suspension is handled by the Float X Factory shock. It strikes the perfect balance between grip and comfort.\n• SRAM handles braking with a pair of Maven brakes and 200mm HS2 rotors. Loved at DH World Cups, they’re the most powerful brakes on the market.\n• Hand-built DT SWISS HFR 1700 wheels raise the bar for reliability. Paired with DT 350 hubs, the rolling gear is ready for anything.\n• The new SRAM GX Eagle T-Type drivetrain is solid, reliable, and versatile with a 520% gear range.",
